    "title": "Former Carterville star Amayah Doyle's Tennessee Lady Vols compete June 1 in NCAA play",
    "text": "Former Carterville star Amayah Doyle’s Tennessee Lady Vols compete June 1 in NCAA play\nOn Monday, June 1, the Tennessee Lady Volunteers, featuring former Carterville High School softball standout Amayah Doyle, were defeated 5-2 by the Texas Longhorns in the NCAA Tournament.\nThe matchup was held at Devon Park, beginning at 12 p.m.\nThe Lady Volunteers are scheduled to play again at Devon Park on Monday, June 1, at 2:30 p.m.\nAmayah Doyle — Infielder — Sophomore — 5′10″ — Hometown: Carterville",
